<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Engage &mdash; Literary Science</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: 8rem 3rem 2.5rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  .page-header .page-desc {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--warm-gray); max-width: 500px;
  }

  .offerings {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-dark);
  }

  .offering {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-dark);
    transition: background 0.4s;
  }

  .offering:hover { background: var(--paper-light); }

  .offering-left {
    padding: 3rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--paper-dark);
  }

  .offering-num {
    font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
    font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700;
    opacity: 0.05; line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .offering-title {
    font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .offering-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.45rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faded);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .offering-right {
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .offering-body {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--warm-gray);
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .offering-body + .offering-body { margin-top: 1rem; }

  .offering-formats {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .format-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.45rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--paper-dark);
    color: var(--faded);
  }

  .offering-cta {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .offering-cta a {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.52rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    transition: all 0.3s;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .offering-cta a:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  /* contact strip */
  .contact-strip {
    padding: 4rem 3rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact-strip::before, .contact-strip::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 20px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,
      transparent 0px, transparent 3px,
      rgba(242,242,242,0.03) 3px, rgba(242,242,242,0.03) 4px);
  }
  .contact-strip::before { left: 0; }
  .contact-strip::after { right: 0; }

  .contact-strip h2 {
    font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-strip p {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--paper-dark);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .contact-strip a {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--paper-dark);
    padding: 0.7rem 1.6rem;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .contact-strip a:hover {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .offering { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .offering-left { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-dark); padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
    .offering-right { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Literary Science</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="/epistemology/">The Work</a></li>
    <li><a href="/studio/">Studio</a></li>
    <li><a href="/toolkit/">Toolkit</a></li>
    <li><a href="/work/" class="active">Engage</a></li>
    <li><a href="/newcomm/">NewComm</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="section-label">04 &mdash; The Door</div>
  <h1>Engage</h1>
  <p class="page-desc">Where the studio becomes a practice. For schools, museums, community organizations, and programs ready to go deeper.</p>
</header>

<div class="offerings">

  <div class="offering reveal">
    <div class="offering-left">
      <div class="offering-num">01</div>
      <div class="offering-title">Workshops &amp; Speaking</div>
      <div class="offering-tag">Available Now</div>
    </div>
    <div class="offering-right">
      <p class="offering-body">From the epistemological case to hands-on practice with the methodology. Whether you need a provocation for your next convening or a deep dive for your faculty, the engagement is built around what your organization actually needs.</p>
      <p class="offering-body">Every engagement starts with the same question: what systems are your people navigating, and what literature has already rendered those systems visible?</p>
      <div class="offering-formats">
        <span class="format-tag">Keynote</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Half-Day Workshop</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Full-Day Intensive</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Multi-Day Residency</span>
      </div>
      <div class="offering-cta">
        <a href="#">Inquire &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="offering reveal">
    <div class="offering-left">
      <div class="offering-num">02</div>
      <div class="offering-title">Certification Program</div>
      <div class="offering-tag">First Cohort &mdash; 2027</div>
    </div>
    <div class="offering-right">
      <p class="offering-body">A structured pathway from Practitioner to Resident to Fellow. Learn the methodology. Teach it. Contribute to its evolution. Certification means you don&rsquo;t just understand Literary Science&mdash;you can facilitate it in your own context, with your own community, using your own texts.</p>
      <p class="offering-body">The program is designed for educators, community organizers, museum professionals, curriculum designers, and anyone who works at the intersection of literature, community, and systems change.</p>
      <div class="offering-formats">
        <span class="format-tag">Practitioner</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Resident</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Fellow</span>
      </div>
      <div class="offering-cta">
        <a href="#">Join the Waitlist &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="offering reveal">
    <div class="offering-left">
      <div class="offering-num">03</div>
      <div class="offering-title">Institutional Design</div>
      <div class="offering-tag">By Engagement</div>
    </div>
    <div class="offering-right">
      <p class="offering-body">Program design, curriculum integration, and organizational consulting for institutions ready to implement Literary Science. This is the deepest engagement&mdash;not a workshop about the methodology, but the methodology built into your institution&rsquo;s architecture.</p>
      <p class="offering-body">We work with schools, youth development programs, cultural institutions, and community organizations to design programs where literature from marginalized communities drives real community investigation and action.</p>
      <div class="offering-formats">
        <span class="format-tag">Program Design</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Curriculum Integration</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Organizational Consulting</span>
      </div>
      <div class="offering-cta">
        <a href="#">Start a Conversation &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="contact-strip reveal">
  <h2>Let&rsquo;s talk.</h2>
  <p>Whether you&rsquo;re a school looking to transform how your students engage with literature, or an organization exploring what Literary Science could look like in your context&mdash;it starts with a conversation.</p>
  <a href="mailto:hello@literaryscience.com">hello@literaryscience.com</a>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-left">Literary Science</div>
  <div class="footer-right">A property of Asoluka LLC &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <a href="#">Contact</a> &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; &copy; 2026</div>
</footer>

<script>
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) e.target.classList.add('visible'); });
  }, { threshold: 0.1 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
</script>
</body>
</html>
